    "html": "<p>The graph shows a cycle ABCDA of a sample of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\\:\\textup{mol}\"></span> of an ideal gas, where AB and CD are adiabatic.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The temperature at D is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1000\\:\\textup{K}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the energy transferred to the gas during change DA?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8200\\:\\textup{J}\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12000\\:\\textup{J}\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25000\\:\\textup{J}\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"37000\\:\\textup{J}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
